From: Abhishek <abhishek01789@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 23:46:13 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 41/41] Coverflow: close, minimize and maximize windows from
 the cards

- The selected (centre) card shows its traffic lights while Alt+Tab is
  open, and they work: close, maximize (switches to it), minimize.
- A middle click on any card closes its window; q closes the selected
  one, as in the GNOME extension.
- When a window closes, its card fades out and the next window slides
  into the middle and is selected, so the title label follows. Closing
  the last window ends the switcher.
- Switcher core: only the selected card's title bar buttons act (the
  other cards do not show them), a layout's windowsChanged gets the
  controls, the cards keep a selection the layout made after a close,
  and a fading card keeps its 3D turn.
- debug.windowSwitcher gets a pointer action for tests.
